sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SRC as Any service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant NI as NotificationIntake
    participant DB as notification DB
    participant JOB as EmailOutboxJob
    participant SMTP as SMTP / Mailpit
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Bell in the web app

    SRC->>K: notification.requested {audience, title, body, actionUrl, sendEmail?}
    Note over SRC,K: also user, enrolment and job-posted events keep recipient and batch-member projections up to date
    K->>NI: consume
    NI->>DB: resolve audience: one user, role, batch or course (AudienceResolver)
    NI->>DB: insert notification per user (unique on event id + user, so a replay adds nothing)
    opt email wanted
        NI->>DB: insert email_outbox row (PENDING)
        Note over NI,DB: temporary passwords and reset links go straight into the email, never into a column
    end

    loop every few seconds
        JOB->>DB: take PENDING rows due now
        JOB->>SMTP: send
        alt sent
            JOB->>DB: mark SENT
        else mail server down
            JOB->>DB: attempts + 1, next try later (doubling backoff)
        end
    end

    U->>FE: open the app
    FE->>DB: GET /api/notifications (through the gateway)
    FE-->>U: unread count and list
    U->>FE: click a notification
    FE->>FE: mapActionUrl turns the backend path into an /app route
    FE->>DB: mark read
